cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If ceteris gated a comparison in your work, please cite it.
title: ceteris
abstract: Record benchmark conditions and check captured evidence before comparing measurements. Refuses undeclared gating differences, failed runs, and incomplete required evidence. An optional signal check compares the measurement gap with the observed spread; certificates support offline verification.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Agrawal
    given-names: Anshuman
repository-code: https://github.com/iemAnshuman/ceteris
url: https://github.com/iemAnshuman/ceteris
license: MIT
version: 0.4.0
date-released: 2026-09-12
keywords:
  - benchmarking
  - reproducibility
  - hpc
  - provenance
